{"id":"broly","lines":[{"t":1.92,"end":3.59,"chars":[1],"who":"Goku","text":"*Grunt*","de":"*Grunzt*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":3.59,"end":6.5,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"Huh? *Light grunt*","de":"Huh? *Leichtes Grunzen*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":6.5,"end":7.78,"chars":[1],"who":"Goku","text":"HURRAHHH!","de":"HURRAAA!","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":7.78,"end":15.43,"chars":[3],"who":"Paragus","text":"*Shocked* It can't be. What King Vegeta said might- might actually have been the truth.","de":"*Geschockt* Das kann nicht sein. Was König Vegeta gesagt hat, könnte tatsächlich wahr gewesen sein.","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":15.43,"end":18.02,"chars":[3],"who":"Paragus","text":"Broly's a danger to us all.","de":"Broly ist eine Gefahr für uns alle.","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":18.02,"end":18.65,"chars":[1],"who":"Goku","text":"Huuhn!","de":"Huuh!","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":18.65,"end":19.13,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"*Pained growl*","de":"*Schmerzvolles Knurren*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":19.13,"end":21.27,"chars":[1],"who":"Goku","text":"*Clashing grunts*","de":"*Aufeinanderprallende Grunzer*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":19.13,"end":21.35,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"*Clashing grunts*","de":"*Aufeinanderprallende Grunzer*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":21.35,"end":22.15,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"*Pained growl* (bro idk)","de":"*Schmerzvolles Knurren*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":22.15,"end":22.2,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"Huah *Yell*","de":"Huah *Schrei*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":22.2,"end":27.95,"chars":[1],"who":"Goku","text":"*Grunts followed by HURAHHHHH*","de":"*Grunzer, gefolgt von HURAAA*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":27.95,"end":31.3,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"*Usual Broly Super yell*","de":"*Typischer Broly-Super-Schrei*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":31.3,"end":33.58,"chars":[4],"who":"Frieza","text":"This doesn't look good.","de":"Das sieht nicht gut aus.","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":33.58,"end":35.88,"chars":[4],"who":"Frieza","text":"Do you think he's really finished this time?","de":"Glaubst du, er ist diesmal wirklich am Ende?","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":35.88,"end":37.3,"chars":[3],"who":"Paragus","text":"I'm afraid so.","de":"Ich fürchte schon.","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":37.3,"end":39.21,"chars":[4],"who":"Frieza","text":"I'm not so sure.","de":"Da bin ich mir nicht so sicher.","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":39.21,"end":42.7,"chars":[5],"who":"Krillin","text":"GOKU- AHHHHH","de":"GOKU— AAAHHH","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":42.7,"end":46.59,"chars":[4],"who":"Frieza","text":"Shall we put him to a little test?","de":"Sollen wir ihn mal ein bisschen testen?","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":46.59,"end":49.04,"chars":[3],"who":"Paragus","text":"*Confused/scared huhs*","de":"*Verwirrtes, verängstigtes Huh*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":49.04,"end":50.41,"chars":[4],"who":"Frieza","text":"Heh.","de":"Heh.","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":50.41,"end":53.11,"chars":[3],"who":"Paragus","text":"*Grunt and fading groan*","de":"*Grunzen und verklingendes Stöhnen*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":53.11,"end":58.55,"chars":[4],"who":"Frieza","text":"*Clears throat* Broly look! It's such a tragedy!","de":"*Räuspert sich* Broly, schau! So eine Tragödie!","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/23.mp3"},{"t":58.55,"end":60.45,"chars":[1],"who":"Goku","text":"*Clashing sounds*","de":"*Aufeinanderprallende Geräusche*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":58.55,"end":59.45,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"*Clashing sounds*","de":"*Aufeinanderprallende Geräusche*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":59.45,"end":60.91,"chars":[4],"who":"Frieza","text":"Do you hear me?!","de":"Hörst du mich?!","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":60.91,"end":61.66,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"HUH?","de":"HUH?","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":61.66,"end":66.11,"chars":[3],"who":"Paragus","text":"It's your father! He was killed by a stray energy blast!","de":"Es war dein Vater! Er wurde von einem verirrten Energieblitz getötet!","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/28.mp3"},{"t":66.11,"end":69.68,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"*Gasp*","de":"*Keucht*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/29.mp3"},{"t":69.68,"end":75.18,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"*Gruff whimpering* AHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!","de":"*Grobes Wimmern* AAAAAAHHHHH!","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/30.mp3"},{"t":75.18,"end":85.98,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"*Heavy breath* RAHHH- AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!!!","de":"*Schwerer Atem* RAAH— AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!!!","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/31.mp3"},{"t":85.98,"end":94.84,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!!! *Grunts*","de":"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!!! *Grunzt*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/32.mp3"},{"t":94.84,"end":106.56,"chars":[1],"who":"Goku","text":"Hurhn?","de":"Hurhn?","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/33.mp3"},{"t":106.56,"end":107.12,"chars":[1],"who":"Goku","text":"*Small grunt*","de":"*Kleines Grunzen*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/34.mp3"},{"t":107.12,"end":117.72,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"HURAHHHHHHHHHH *Vocalized gasp* HURAHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!!!","de":"HURAAAAAAAAA *Hörbares Keuchen* HURAAAAAAAAAA!!!","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/35.mp3"},{"t":117.72,"end":120.82,"chars":[4],"who":"Frieza","text":"Yes! There it is! Show me your powahhh!","de":"Ja! Da ist es! Zeig mir deine Kraaaft!","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/36.mp3"},{"t":120.82,"end":124.3,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"*More Broly growl yelling*","de":"*Noch mehr Broly-Knurr-Geschrei*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/37.mp3"},{"t":124.3,"end":125.39,"chars":[1],"who":"Goku","text":"*Grunt*","de":"*Grunzt*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/38.mp3"},{"t":125.39,"end":135.56,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"*Some more HUR followed by RAHHHHHH!!!*","de":"*Noch mehr HUR gefolgt von RAAAAAA!!!*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/39.mp3"},{"t":135.56,"end":137.02,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"HUAHHHHHHHHHH!","de":"HUAAAAAAAAA!","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/40.mp3"},{"t":137.02,"end":145.54,"chars":[1],"who":"Goku","text":"*Goku dodging noises*","de":"*Goku weicht aus, Geräusche*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/41.mp3"},{"t":145.54,"end":148.44,"chars":[4],"who":"Frieza","text":"*Light chuckle*","de":"*Leichtes Kichern*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/42.mp3"},{"t":148.44,"end":153.47,"chars":[1],"who":"Goku","text":"HurrahhhhHHHHHH! *Intense grunting*","de":"HURAAAAAAHHHH! *Intensives Grunzen*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/43.mp3"},{"t":153.47,"end":163.22,"chars":[2],"who":"Broly","text":"AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH (Does this guy like, do ANYTHING else?)","de":"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA (Kann der Typ eigentlich noch irgendwas anderes?)","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/44.mp3"},{"t":163.22,"end":168.27,"chars":[1],"who":"Goku","text":"Heh. *Grunt*","de":"Heh. *Grunzt*","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/45.mp3"},{"t":168.27,"end":172.93,"chars":[4],"who":"Frieza","text":"What a lovely sight. That was the anger I wanted to see.","de":"Was für ein schöner Anblick. Genau diese Wut wollte ich sehen.","orig":"scenes/broly/lines/46.mp3"}]}